{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_myrtle_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_myrtle_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "任務報告填寫指南",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_myrtle_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "944c502073bc27dc40805a5be4b9d2708ad6b2dfdbcfa9ea266923bce30f721a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，蘇珊，能聽到嗎？敵方攜帶了情報中未提及的重武器，我們需要火力支援！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，你在哪——該死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車隊首領",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不該追到這來的，他們竟然還用這種武器對付我們......我早就說了，和那些傢伙作對不會有好下場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車隊首領",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在走還來得及是不是？貨我們不要了！快......快跑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快趴下！蠢貨！不要離開掩體！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在這情況慌也沒用，都消停點，我想想辦法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家不要私自行動，保證都待在我周圍！我會給大家提供支援的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要放棄啊各位！我們已經走到這裡了，把貨搶回來，回去就有薪水吃大餐了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車隊首領",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃、吃什麼！命都要保不住了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我媽媽和我講過，一旦退縮就離失敗不遠了！他們人不多，我們團結起來，加油，一定能把他們打得落花流水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣好了，我來給大家鼓勁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在不是做這個的時候！他們的補給庫應該在那裡，射程範圍......換個位置或許能行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對面的火力怎麼突然降下來了？！好機會！桃金娘，快帶他們轉移......桃金娘？人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你在做什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒野強盜首領",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹什麼？為什麼停下了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒野強盜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頭兒，你看對面，不太對勁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，你......吃飽了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我吃飽了，啊......這塊烤腿肉你拿去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就不客氣啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢點，小心噎到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘，搞定上次任務上面可給我們多放了足足五天假，接下來每天你都能來吃大餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以說，每一天才都不能浪費......啊，對了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起任務，我早上突然在桌上發現了這個，上面寫著......呃......“任務匯報表（外勤幹員）”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們知道這是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有交任務報告嗎？這可是你的第一個任務，沒人告訴你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任務報告......喔，好像在哪裡看到過，但我不知道要寫在哪，後面就沒管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來任務報告要寫在這上面的呀，寫完就能交了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單！我現在就寫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給，衛生紙，把手上的油擦擦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格，我們去把盤子倒一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊！我寫完啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼快？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小菜一碟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看一眼......報告......任務已完成。你只寫了這一句？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“報告——任務已經順利完成了。”沒問題呀！有哪裡錯了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......桃金娘，你是不是不知道任務報告是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然知道。我在老家給蜜酒店看貨的時候，確認貨物都放好了，就要在單子上寫“已放好”。任務報告也差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過每次都要寫三個字實在太麻煩了，後來我想了個辦法，檢查完一項，就在後面打個勾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多簡單！我厲害吧？嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我還是解釋一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任務做完了後，在任務匯報表中寫上你在任務中做了什麼和怎麼想的，這些寫完了才叫作任務報告，不然就只是一張紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寫完後的任務報告要提交給人事部，再提交給你的上級。這對幹員來說非常重要，你一定要認真填才可以哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸！這麼麻煩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那我把空著的地方都填滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "代號，桃金娘......戰鬥經驗，唔......從五歲在第一大道收拾不講禮貌的酗酒大叔開始算起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不用寫這些......桃金娘，看一下你的終端。我發給你一個範本。你就對著範本先把前面幾欄填了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好咧！有範本那就容易多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，霍格......我們這次提交任務報告的時限是不是就截止到昨天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我想起來了，我就是趕在截止前交上去的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，上面的我都填完啦，再幫我看一眼——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意思是......我的報告交不上去了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想想......按照流程，現在任務報告應該還在人事部進行整理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我第一次出任務，就漏掉了這麼重要的東西......我不會連試用期都過不了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘，你先冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有沒有別的辦法？我現在偷偷溜進人事部還來得及嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溜、溜進去？啊——霍格，你認識的人事部的人多，知不知道他們整理資料的流程要多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概兩到三天吧，現在應該還在......嘶，你不會真想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要整理的時候表在紙堆裡，他們就不會發現有人漏交了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的可以溜進去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣不符合規定吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦，我記起來了！我在入職手冊上讀到過，規定說的是必須提交任務報告，又沒說什麼時候怎樣提交！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是早記起來就沒現在這事了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——忽然就鬆了口氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，現在還不是放鬆的時候。得以最快的速度把報告寫完，才能趕在報告被收走前放進去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......剩下的任務報告，為了避免出錯，我們一起幫你回憶，把想到的記下來，明白了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嚴肅——好、好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先從你參與任務開始寫，還有印象嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然！我們就是跟著那個大叔的車隊進入荒野的嘛！任務目標是護送他的車隊到達目的地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，寫上去吧。後來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來......後來那天太陽可曬了，空氣也好乾。我想，地上竟然還有這樣的地方，下次來應該多塗點防曬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種和任務無關的想法不用寫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣好了，我說一段，你照著我說的寫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，護衛行動開始後，我隨著隊伍在荒野上前進，前半程除野獸襲擾外沒有異樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寫好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在下午四時零四分......注意分鐘前面有個零。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們遭遇了埋伏在荒野上的強盜，我負責了支援戰場和保護車隊眾人的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在戰鬥中，我根據敵方的攻勢做出判斷，在恰當的時機卸下車載的貨物，借此成功擊退了一波來襲的敵人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寫好了沒？我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“然後，我不小心把敵人趕跑了”......你這寫的和我說的完全不一樣吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一句話就概括了，很簡潔吧？當時的情況就是這樣的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這樣？可是我看到你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，當時我負責的是保護那些大叔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們在那邊“劈哩啪啦”打架的時候，我看到有好多人突然從另一邊衝過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身為大將軍，當然懂得敵進我退的道理。我就把大叔們都喊上車，想讓他們趕緊溜掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後你不是卸下了貨物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要把貨物扔了才跑得快呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以那只是一場意外？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，是不是該按照她說的記上去啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寫上去應該沒問題......但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘，最好你也復盤一下為什麼意外能造成這樣的效果，這同樣也是你寫任務報告的一環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？沒有想到的事情也要寫上去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們寫任務報告的目的，不僅是為了讓別人看明白我們做事情的方式，為指揮人員以後規劃行動提供依據，也是為了自我反思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平時我們遇到這種情況，先要考慮局勢，平衡利害關係後找到解決辦法，再付諸行動。寫任務報告就是為了寫那時的思路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是當時沒有思路的話，就在寫報告的時候梳理一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，懂了。就是每一個行動對應一個想法，作戰時沒有想到的寫的時候再好好想想，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，那剩下的我可以自己寫寫看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也行，你寫完了我幫你看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，霍格，有件事我們得提前聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是追到強盜老巢搶回貨物那裡......那個地方我們彼此的行動都不一樣，我沒和你們兩個在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正在高處架設狙擊弩，提供火力掩護，你們應該是在正面和強盜戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時的行動我有些不清楚的地方，我們最好再整體對一遍，以防桃金娘......思維發散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！那一場架我記得！在他們基地門口打起來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來想帶著大家衝鋒陷陣，但是我第一次見到這樣的戰場......只能招呼大家躲起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經幫了大忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有還有。本來是我們佔優勢的，直到對面掏出來一個那——麼——長的大傢伙，“轟”的一聲，把一輛車給炸飛了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格！要不是你拉著我們躲起來，我們也要被炸上天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情報裡確實沒有提到他們擁有重武器，很可能是他們最近才搶到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在對講機裡也聽到你說這個情況了。當時場上煙霧太大，我忙著調整位置推算距離，沒看清發生了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我一直很奇怪......你們怎麼就頂著火力衝到陣前，把他們都幹掉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格，你當時做了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，和我沒關係，是桃金娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格！那一刻多虧了他！他太厲害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你別不相信，我親眼見到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格一聲高呼，躍出掩體，一個人衝了出去。後面的人看著他，也全都衝上去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對面那群強盜就和中了法術一樣，呆呆地立在那，絕對是被嚇傻了，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格上去，啪！一拳就打倒了一個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你們怎麼都不說話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的行動每一點我都記得很明白！那我就按照剛剛說的寫上去啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘，那個時候你做了什麼？你自己不記得了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？就是霍格你安排的那樣，照看好在場人員的安全，力所能及地支援，最後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做大將軍該做的，給大家鼓勁打氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別看我第一次在地上工作，我最擅長這個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是這樣的。桃金娘，我們能取得勝利，不都是因為你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格，可別開我玩笑啦。媽媽說了，沒有做過的事情是不能承認的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，當時是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看見桃金娘突然跑到車隊眾人的前面，跳上當掩體的越野車，然後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她把那面白色的旗子舉了起來，高高地揮來揮去，那個地方所有人一定都能看得清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那會兒把我嚇壞了，剛想拉下她的時候我忽然發現......不止我們，對面的敵人也看傻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就趕緊抓住他們停火的間隙衝了上去，剩下的事和她描述的一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！你是說我揮舞旗子這件事呀。哈哈，我都快忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那根本不算什麼吧，就是大將軍的本職工作——振奮士氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要大家都看向我，就一定能打起精神的！在老家我這麼做效果可好啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就、就這麼簡單？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呀。要做成一件事，得先讓大家團結起來。許多人一起努力，事情總能搞得定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想了很久，你到底是怎樣想出“舉白旗”的點子的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過按你們說的，這應該又造成什麼我沒想到的效果了吧。唔，我大概明白這裡要怎麼寫了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算寫什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然是我的反思呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“有時候我會造成一些連我自己都沒想到的效果，但是我的隊友都能很好地把握機會，把敵人打倒。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“所以，我要信任站在我身後的人，用盡全力支援大家......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？這麼寫準沒問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格，雖然她反思得很有道理，但......我還是不放心。按照她的想法來寫，重點可能會完全搞錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......再看看她怎麼寫的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，手好酸......這樣算寫完了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。算是可以提交的狀態了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然寫得很累，但是大概明白了你們是怎麼工作的，很有收穫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定你真的明白了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心好了！接下來是不是就到了......最激動人心的環節了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霍格，你去看了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這時候人事部他們都在開會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們辦公室裡面什麼樣我大概知道，悄悄交過去感覺能行，唯一擔心的是萬一有人中途回來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣，桃金娘，你先拿著報告去人事部門口等我們。我們再幫你去會議室附近偵察一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切記，千萬不要讓人事部的同事看見你帶著報告！一旦被發現，我們的行動就失敗了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，這事我肯定能搞定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我們開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三十分鐘後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果......她到現在還沒來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會不會已經進去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太可能。你都沒和她說該把報告放在什麼地方......總不能這一步也被她找到什麼辦法了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——小點聲，人事部的幹員都回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，你看那個人，他手上拿的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘的報告！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇珊，晚上好！有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好！我想問一下......桃金娘的報告，你是從哪裡拿到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你問這個幹嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是因為......啊對，我之前和桃金娘一起出了任務，任務報告不是之前就交了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你們專門把桃金娘的報告拿出來，我擔心有什麼......差錯，對，差錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，沒有什麼問題。事實上我也覺得很奇怪，因為這份報告是博士剛拿來給我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士還說什麼，“以後還是給新人們多寬限一點提交時間吧”之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可明明新人的提交截止日還沒到哇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒到？那我們剛才忙半天——哎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉打擾了——霍格，我們趕快去找她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！兩位！我在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來找你們了，你們要去哪裡呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘？你去哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛從博士的辦公室回來......抱歉，讓你們久等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼會去博士那邊？報告怎麼又到博士手裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是想和你們說這件事來著！是我在來這裡的路上遇到博士了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士問我最近還習慣嗎，我就把我沒交報告的事和博士講了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士不是人事部的，告訴他肯定沒關係的。這麼想應該沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士說把報告給他就沒問題了，我想了想，既然他是我的上級，總是要給他的，就把報告給他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然事情順利地解決了，但是想到你們在這裡等我，我遲到了很不禮貌，所以我想了個辦法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我請博士帶我去他辦公室，抓了一把特別好吃的糖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桃金娘",
      "speakerId": "avg_151_myrtle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃了糖，你們就不要生我的氣了，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......給我來一塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodescom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位，這次麻煩你們跑一趟，是想和你們確認一下桃金娘在任務過程中的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，請不要擔心，不是哪裡出了問題。最近桃金娘和你們一起出的任務都非常順利，我們只是想再瞭解一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......還是想知道一下原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。是這樣的，問題在於你們二位提交的任務報告，和桃金娘提交的任務報告......內容上有較大的差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老實說，看起來就像不是同一個任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她不是說已經完全理解了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是就這麼放心了，還是我們有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及......上一次任務結束後，她隨報告提交的還有一些手繪的圖畫......你們可以看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桃金娘......括弧......大將軍的戰術大全？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她似乎覺得，與她一起行動的幹員們應當瞭解她的作戰思路。所以她編寫了這個冊子想要放在我們這，供幹員們借閱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是與她相處比較多的幹員，鑑於以上這些情況，你們對她會不會有......一些疑問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......霍格，你有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肯定的，誰沒有啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我覺得這沒什麼影響。桃金娘總有辦法讓事情變得簡單，她有這份天賦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，比起嘗試靠這些圖畫去理解她，跟著她發起衝鋒才是更容易的事。像桃金娘這樣優秀的幹員，當然值得我們信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞭解。那我們這邊就沒有別的問題了。辛苦跑一趟，二位可以離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低聲）霍格，我剛才說的結論應該沒問題吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員霍格",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低聲）大概......吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幹員蘇珊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......不好意思......桃金娘的“戰術大全”，可以先借我們看兩天嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
